 900:middleware/FreeRTOS-Kernel/portable/GCC/ARM_CM4F/port.c ****          * devices by calling NVIC_SetPriorityGrouping( 0 ); before starting the
 901:middleware/FreeRTOS-Kernel/portable/GCC/ARM_CM4F/port.c ****          * scheduler.  Note however that some vendor specific peripheral libraries
 902:middleware/FreeRTOS-Kernel/portable/GCC/ARM_CM4F/port.c ****          * assume a non-zero priority group setting, in which cases using a value
 903:middleware/FreeRTOS-Kernel/portable/GCC/ARM_CM4F/port.c ****          * of zero will result in unpredictable behaviour. */
